  "item_short_desc": "<p>Explore the durability and comfort of Rothco's Long Sleeve Solid T-Shirts, crafted from a reliable 60% cotton/40% polyester blend (100% cotton for Desert Sand). These shirts are built to endure any occasion, offering a lightweight feel for comfort. The tagless label on the crew neck enhances the overall comfort, making it an ideal choice for extended wear. Designed for versatility, these service-style long sleeve shirts are perfect for screen printing, allowing you to add your personal touch.</p>",
  "no_ratings": null,
  "sort_order": "15998",
  "description": "<p>Explore the durability and comfort of Rothco's Long Sleeve Solid T-Shirts, crafted from a reliable 60% cotton/40% polyester blend (100% cotton for Desert Sand). These shirts are built to endure any occasion, offering a lightweight feel for comfort. The tagless label on the crew neck enhances the overall comfort, making it an ideal choice for extended wear. Designed for versatility, these service-style long sleeve shirts are perfect for screen printing, allowing you to add your personal touch. Whether you're gearing up for casual outings, outdoor adventures, team sports, tactical activities, or layering beneath a vest, Rothco's Long Sleeve Solid T-Shirts are the perfect blend of style and functionality.</p>",
